NOTE ON shared/:

This license covers this repository's own code and documentation (docs,
templates, scripts, gallery content, and original material in shared/).

`shared/` also carries a local patch series against third-party sources
(currently the SDL3 DOS backend). Those patches inherit the license of the
project they patch. See THIRD-PARTY.md for the per-component breakdown.
Nothing in this repository vendors or redistributes any port's game engine
source or game assets -- those live in that port's own repository under its
own licensing terms.
